+# RecSys embedding-cache adapter
+
+This directory provides the frozen `prepare`, `run`, and `summarize` entry for a native HKV/FBGEMM GPU embedding-cache service comparison. It is an optional overlay on the exact RecSys commit recorded in `benchmark/native_tbe/README.md` of the HKV source tree. The external FBGEMM operator is used directly; the separate synthetic cache-pipeline ablation is not an FBGEMM result. Inputs, binary identities, full correctness checks, and unfinished budget gates are described in that top-level README.
