+            "atol": ATOL,
+            "initial_restore_and_counters": "exact",
+        },
+        "scope": "two fresh native instances restore the same checkpoint; repeat the first real train batch so dirty keys are re-read; both flush to inspect full backing after every update, only one explicitly clears its cache; compare full embeddings, all native optimizer rows/globals, dense weights/Adagrad state, predictions and losses",
